T = {
11:"kāna hunāka Manu, ibnu Fīvāsfāt (ash-shams), al-mukarramu ʿinda al-ḥukamāʾ, awwalu al-mulūk, kamā anna maqṭaʿa «Ōm» awwalu al-awzāni al-fīdiyya.",
12:"wa-fī sulālatihi aṭ-ṭāhirati wulida qamarun bayna al-mulūki ismuhu Dīlība, aṭharu minhā, ka-l-qamari al-mawlūdi min muḥīṭi al-laban.",
13:"ʿarīḍu aṣ-ṣadr, katifāhu ka-katifay ath-thawr, ṭawīlun ka-shajarati as-sālā, qawiyyu adh-dhirāʿayn, ka-annahu wājibu al-muḥāribi nafsuhu wa-qad ittakhadha jasadan yalīqu bi-ʿamalihi.",
14:"bi-jasadin yafūqu al-jamīʿa quwwatan wa-yaṭghā ʿalā al-jamīʿi bahāʾan wa-yaʿlū ʿalayhim jamīʿan, waqafa mughaṭṭiyan al-arḍa ka-jabali Mīrū.",
15:"kānat ḥikmatuhu ʿalā qadri hayʾatihi, wa-ʿilmuhu ʿalā qadri ḥikmatihi, wa-masāʿīhi ʿalā qadri ʿilmihi, wa-najāḥuhu ʿalā qadri masāʿīhi.",
16:"bi-ṣifātihi al-malakiyyati al-mahībati wa-al-maḥbūbati maʿan, kāna li-raʿiyyatihi manīʿan wa-qarība al-manāli fī ān, ka-l-muḥīṭi bi-wuḥūshihi al-baḥriyyati wa-jawāhirihi.",
17:"raʿiyyatuhu, wa-huwa yaqūduhā ka-s-sāʾiq, lam taḥid ka-iṭāri al-ʿajalati qayda khaṭṭin ʿan aṭ-ṭarīqi al-maṭrūqi mundhu Manu.",
18:"lam yaʾkhudh aḍ-ḍarāʾiba min raʿiyyatihi illā li-rakhāʾihā; fa-sh-shamsu lā tamtaṣṣu al-māʾa illā li-taruddahu alfa ḍiʿf.",
19:"kāna jayshuhu mujarrada ḥāshiya; wa-wasīlatāhu li-bulūghi ghāyātihi ithnatāni faqaṭ: ʿaqlun lā yakillu fī ash-shāstrā, wa-watarun mashdūdun ʿalā al-qaws.",
20:"kāna yaktumu mashūrātihi wa-yukhfī malāmiḥahu wa-ishārātihi; fa-lā tuʿrafu masāʿīhi illā bi-thimārihā, ka-āthāri ḥayātin sābiqa.",
21:"ḥamā nafsahu bi-lā khawf, wa-mārasa ad-dārmā bi-lā ʿilla, wa-iktasaba al-māla bi-lā ṭamaʿ, wa-tamattaʿa bi-l-ladhdhati bi-lā taʿalluq.",
22:"aṣ-ṣamtu maʿa al-ʿilm, wa-al-ḥilmu maʿa al-qudra, wa-tarku at-tabāhī maʿa al-karam: wa-li-anna kulla faḍīlatin iqtaranat bi-ḍiddihā, badat faḍāʾiluhu ka-annahā wulidat maʿa ikhwa.",
23:"lam tajdhibhu mawḍūʿātu al-ḥawāss, wa-balagha ash-shāṭiʾa al-abʿada li-kulli al-ʿulūm, wa-kāna mukhliṣan li-d-dārmā, fa-nāla nuḍja ash-shaykhūkhati bi-lā shaykhūkha.",
24:"li-annahu kāna yuʾaddibu raʿiyyatahu wa-yaḥmīhā wa-yaʿūluhā, kāna huwa abāhā; ammā ābāʾuhum fa-lam yakūnū illā sababa wilādatihim.",
25:"kāna yuʿāqibu al-mudhnibīna ḥifẓan li-n-niẓām, wa-tazawwaja min ajli adh-dhurriyya; fa-kānat ath-tharwatu wa-al-ladhdhatu ʿinda hādhā al-maliki al-ḥakīmi fī khidmati ad-dārmā waḥdahā.",
26:"ḥalaba al-arḍa min ajli al-qurbān, wa-ḥalaba Indrā as-samāʾa min ajli al-maḥāṣīl; wa-bi-hādhā at-tabādul fī al-khayrāti aqāma al-ithnāni al-ʿālamayn.",
27:"lam yastaṭiʿ al-mulūku al-ākharūna mujārāta majdi hādhā al-ḥāmī; idh lam tabqa as-sariqa, wa-qad inṣarafat ʿan māli al-ghayr, illā kalimatan tusmaʿ.",
28:"kāna ar-rajulu aṣ-ṣāliḥu, wa-law ʿaduwwan, maqbūlan ʿindahu ka-d-dawāʾi ʿinda al-marīḍ; wa-kāna ash-shirrīru, wa-law ḥabīban, yunbadhu ka-iṣbaʿin ladaghat-hā afʿā.",
29:"lā shakka anna al-khāliqa ṣanaʿahu min al-ʿanāṣiri al-ʿuẓmā; fa-mithluhā kānat kullu ṣifātihi lā tuthmiru illā li-l-ākharīn.",
30:"ḥakama al-arḍa al-muḥāṭata bi-s-sāḥili ka-s-sūr, wa-al-muḥīṭu khandaquhā, lā taʿrifu ḥākiman ghayrahu, ka-annahā madīnatun wāḥida.",
31:"kānat lahu zawjatun min sulālati Māghadhā tudʿā Sūdākshīnā — ismun nālat-hu bi-luṭfihā — kamā anna Dākshīnā qarīnatu al-qurbān.",
32:"wa-maʿa anna ḥarīmahu kāna kabīran, lam yaʿudda sayyidu al-arḍi nafsahu mutazawwijan illā bi-tilka as-sayyidati ar-rafīʿati an-nafs wa-bi-Lākshmī, ḥaẓẓi al-malik.",
33:"wa-huwa yatūqu ilā ibnin minhā, wa-hiya jadīratun bihi, qaḍā az-zamana fī amānin taʾakhkhara taḥaqququhā.",
34:"li-adāʾi aṭ-ṭaqsi min ajli adh-dhurriyya, anzala ʿan dhirāʿihi nīra al-ʿālami ath-thaqīl wa-waḍaʿahu ʿalā wuzarāʾihi.",
35:"thumma baʿda an ʿabadā al-khāliqa raghbatan fī ibn, tawajjaha az-zawjāni al-mutaṭahhirāni ilā ṣawmaʿati muʿallimihimā Fāsishthā.",
36:"rakibā ʿarabatan wāḥidatan dhāta hadīrin nāʿimin ʿamīq, ka-l-barqi wa-Āyrāwātā ʿalā saḥābati al-mawsimi al-māṭir.",
37:"li-allā tuzʿaja aṣ-ṣawmaʿa, lam yaṣṭaḥibā illā qalīlan min al-khadam; lākinnahumā bi-jalālihimā al-khāṣṣi badawā ka-anna jayshan yuḥīṭu bihimā.",
38:"kānat takhdumuhumā nasāʾimu laṭīfatu al-malmas, ʿabiqatun bi-ṣamghi as-sālā, tanthuru liqāḥa al-azhār wa-tahuzzu ṣufūfa ashjāri al-ghāba.",
39:"kānā yastamiʿāni ilā ṣayḥāti aṭ-ṭawāwīsi al-badīʿa allatī rafaʿat ruʾūsahā li-ṣawti ʿajalāti al-ʿaraba, fa-aṭlaqat nidāʾātin min maqṭaʿayn muwāfiqatan li-naghmati Shādjā.",
40:"fī azwāji aẓ-ẓibāʾi allatī ibtaʿadat qalīlan ʿan aṭ-ṭarīq wa-thabbatat naẓarahā ʿalā al-ʿaraba, raʾayā shabaha ʿaynay kullin minhumā bi-ʿaynay al-ākhar.",
41:"kānā yarfaʿāni wajhayhimā bayna ḥīnin wa-ākhar naḥwa ṭuyūri al-karkiyyi al-ʿadhbati aṣ-ṣawt allatī taṭīru fī ṣaffin fa-taṣnaʿu iklīlan li-qawsin bi-lā aʿmida.",
42:"wa-li-anna ar-rīḥa kānat muwātiya, tubashshiru bi-najāḥi duʿāʾihimā, lam yamassa al-ghubāru alladhī athārat-hu al-khaylu shaʿrahā wa-lā ʿimāmatahu.",
43:"fī al-buḥayrāti kānā yastanshiqāni ʿabīra al-lūtus, al-mubarrada bi-tamawwuji al-amwāj, ash-shabīha bi-anfāsihimā.",
44:"fī quran wahabāhā bi-nafsayhimā, taʿlūhā aʿmidatu al-qarābīn, talaqqayā baʿda māʾi at-tarḥībi mubāsharatan barakāti al-muḍaḥḥīna allatī lā takhīb.",
45:"kānā yasʾalāni shuyūkha qurā ar-ruʿāh, alladhīna jāʾū bi-z-zubdati aṭ-ṭāzaja, ʿan asmāʾi al-ashjāri al-barriyyati ʿalā aṭ-ṭarīq.",
46:"wa-humā yasīrāni fī thiyābin naqiyya, kāna lahumā jamālun lā yūṣaf, ka-iqtirāni najmi Tshītrā wa-al-qamari wa-qad injalā ʿanhumā aḍ-ḍabāb.",
47:"al-maliku al-wasīm, al-ḥakīmu ka-Būdhā (ʿUṭārid), wa-huwa yurī zawjatahu hādhā wa-dhāk, lam yantabih ḥattā ilā aṭ-ṭarīqi alladhī qaṭaʿahu.",
48:"fī al-masāʾi balagha dhālika al-maliku ṣaʿbu al-manāli majduhu, bi-khaylin mutʿaba wa-maʿa malikatihi, ṣawmaʿata dhālika al-ḥakīmi al-ʿaẓīmi aḍ-ḍābiṭi li-nafsihi.",
49:"kānat aṣ-ṣawmaʿatu tamtaliʾu bi-n-nussāki al-ʿāʾidīna min aʿmāqi al-ghābati bi-l-ḥaṭabi wa-ʿushbi al-kūshā wa-ath-thimār, tastaqbiluhum an-nīrānu al-muqaddasatu al-khafiyya.",
50:"kānat muzdaḥimatan bi-ẓ-ẓibāʾi allatī tasuddu abwāba al-akwākh, al-muʿtādati ʿalā naṣībihā min al-aruzzi al-barrī ka-annahā abnāʾu zawjāti al-ḥukamāʾ.",
51:"hunāka kānat banātu al-ḥukamāʾ, ʿinda farāghihinna min as-saqy, yatrukna ash-shujayrāti fawran kay taṭmaʾinna aṭ-ṭuyūru ash-shāribatu min aḥwāḍi al-judhūr.",
52:"fī afniyati al-akwākh, ḥaythu jumiʿa al-aruzzu al-barriyyu (al-manshūru li-t-tajfīf) ʿinda inqiḍāʾi ash-shams, kānat aẓ-ẓibāʾu ar-rābiḍatu tajtarr.",
53:"bi-dukhānihā alladhī taḥmiluhu ar-rīḥ, al-ʿabiqi bi-l-qarābīni wa-al-munbiʾi bi-īqādi an-nīrān, kānat aṣ-ṣawmaʿatu tuṭahhiru aḍ-ḍuyūfa al-qādimīna ilayhā.",
54:"thumma qāla li-s-sāʾiq: «arīḥi al-khayl», wa-anzala zawjatahu min al-ʿaraba, wa-nazala huwa ayḍan.",
55:"akrama al-ḥukamāʾu al-muhadhdhabūn, aḍ-ḍābiṭūna li-ḥawāssihim tamāman, al-malika al-jadīr, al-ḥāmiya al-qādima maʿa zawjatihi, alladhī ittakhadha as-siyāsata ʿaynan lahu.",
56:"fī nihāyati ṭaqsi al-masāʾi raʾā dhālika al-kanza min az-zuhd, turāfiquhu Arūndhātī, ka-Āgnī turāfiquhu Sfāhā.",
57:"amsaka al-maliku wa-al-malikatu al-māghadhiyyatu bi-qadamay al-ithnayn; wa-istaqbalahumā al-muʿallimu wa-zawjatuhu bi-mawadda.",
58:"lammā khaffafa karamu aḍ-ḍiyāfati ʿanāʾa al-ʿarabati al-muhtazza, saʾala al-ḥakīmu al-malika — al-ḥakīma as-sākina fī ṣawmaʿati al-mulk — ʿan khayri mamlakatihi.",
59:"thumma badaʾa sayyidu ath-tharwa, fātiḥu mudun al-aʿdāʾ wa-afḍalu al-mutakallimīn, amāma dhālika al-kanzi min al-Atharfā Fīdā kalāman dhā maʿnā.",
60:"lā shakka anna al-aḥwāla bi-khayrin fī aʿḍāʾi mamlakatī as-sabʿa, idh anta man yadfaʿu ʿannī al-maṣāʾib, al-ilāhiyyata wa-al-bashariyya.",
61:"taʿāwīdhuka, yā muʾallifa at-taʿāwīdh, tukhḍiʿu aʿdāʾī min baʿīd, fa-taṣīru sihāmī allatī lā tuṣību illā al-ahdāfa al-marʾiyyata ka-annahā marfūḍa.",
62:"ayyuhā al-kāhin, al-qurbānu alladhī taskubuhu kamā yanbaghī fī an-nīrān yaṣīru maṭaran li-l-maḥāṣīli adh-dhābilati fī al-jafāf.",
63:"an yaʿīsha raʿāyāya ʿumra al-insāni kāmilan, bi-lā khawfin wa-lā āfāt, fa-dhālika bi-faḍli quwwatika ar-rūḥiyya.",
64:"wa-anta, yā muʿallimī, ibnu Brāhmā, taʿtanī bī hākadhā, fa-kayfa lā takūnu khayrātī muttaṣilatan sālimatan min ash-shurūr?",
65:"lākinnī lam ara baʿdu dhurriyyatan jadīratan min kannatika hādhihi, fa-lā tasurrunī ḥattā al-arḍu bi-juzurihā, wa-in kānat tukhriju al-jawāhir.",
66:"lā shakka anna aslāfī, idh yarawna anna qarābīna kurāti al-aruzzi satanqaṭiʿu baʿdī, lā yaʾkulūna ḥattā ash-shabaʿ fī ash-shrāddhā, bal yaḥriṣūna ʿalā iddikhāri naṣībihim.",
67:"lā shakka anna ajdādī, ẓānnīna annahu sa-yaʿizzu baʿdī, yashrabūna al-māʾa alladhī uqaddimuhu fātiran min zafarātihim.",
68:"muṭahharun fī bāṭinī bi-l-qarābīn, lākinnī muẓlimun li-inʿidāmi adh-dhurriyya, fa-anā muḍīʾun wa-ghayru muḍīʾin maʿan, ka-jabali Lūkālūkā.",
69:"ath-thawābu al-mawlūdu min az-zuhdi wa-al-ʿaṭāʾ yajlibu as-saʿādata fī al-ʿālami al-ākhar; ammā dhurriyyatu as-sulālati aṭ-ṭāhira fa-tajlibu as-saʿādata hunāka wa-hunā.",
70:"ayyuhā al-mudabbir, kayfa tanẓuru ilayya maḥrūman min adh-dhurriyya wa-lā taḥzan, kamā taḥzanu ʿalā shujayratin ʿaqīmin fī ṣawmaʿatika saqaytahā bi-nafsika bi-maḥabba?",
}
